#DESCRIPTION
Magnetic reconnection (Fadeev current-sheet equilibrium) with the FULL PIC
solver (solveEM = T, Maxwell/GMRES): kinetic ions and electrons, on a TWO-LEVEL
AMR grid backed by a 2D AMReX library (AMReX_SPACEDIM = 2, built with
./Config.pl -amrex2d -lev=2).  This is the uniform-grid reconnection test
(tests/reconnection/PARAM.in) with static AMR added: a thin layer around the
central reconnecting current sheet (|y| < 7.85 d_i) is refined with REFINEREGION
to 2x resolution, so the reconnection zone is resolved at dx = dy = 0.98 d_i
while the outer region stays coarse.  Reconnection plane x-y; details in README.

#INITFROMSWMF
F                       initFromSWMF

#GEOMETRY
-31.4                   xMin  [code units; Lx = 2*pi*L*num_islands ~ 62.8 d_i]
 31.4                   xMax
-15.7                   yMin  [code units; Ly = Lx/2 ~ 31.4 d_i]
 15.7                   yMax

#NCELL  (level-0 / base grid)
32                      nCellX
16                      nCellY

#MAXBLOCKSIZE
16                      maxBlockSizeX
2                       maxBlockSizeY

#PERIODICITY
T                       isPeriodicX
F                       isPeriodicY

Field boundary conditions on the box faces (periodic in x, outflow/float in y).
#FIELDBOXBOUNDARY
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryLo  (x)
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryHi
outflow                 fieldBoxBoundaryLo  (y)
outflow                 fieldBoxBoundaryHi

#PARTICLEBOXBOUNDARY
0                       iSpecies
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryHi
outflow                 particleBoxBoundaryLo
outflow                 particleBoxBoundaryHi

Full PIC electromagnetic field solver ON (Maxwell/GMRES E solve).
#SOLVEEM
T                       solveEM

#HYBRIDPIC
F                       useHybridPIC

Two kinetic species: ions (q = 1, m = 1) and electrons (q = -1, m = 1/25)
#PLASMA
2                       nSpecies
1.0                     mass           Species 0: ions
1.0                     charge
1.0/25.0                mass           Species 1: electrons
-1.0                    charge

Both species share the same Fadeev density profile (charge neutral, n_e = n_i);
the ion temperature sets beta_i ~ 0.5 and the electrons are heated to the same
code temperature.
#UNIFORMSTATE
12.5                    rho [amu/cc]   Species 0: ions (n_code ~ nb = 0.2)
0.0                     ux [km/s]
0.0                     uy [km/s]
0.0                     uz [km/s]
304000.0                T [K]          ions, beta_i ~ 0.5
0.5                     rho [amu/cc]   Species 1: electrons (rho_e=rho_i*m_e/m_i => n_e=n_i, charge neutral)
0.0                     ux [km/s]
0.0                     uy [km/s]
0.0                     uz [km/s]
304000.0                T [K]          electrons
0.0                     bx [T]         guide field set by FadeevIC (bg = 0)
0.0                     by [T]
0.0                     bz [T]
0.0                     ex [V/m]
0.0                     ey [V/m]
0.0                     ez [V/m]

Fadeev current-sheet equilibrium initial condition.
#TESTCASE
fadeev

FadeevIC sub-parameters.
#FADEEVIC
5.0                     L        (current-sheet half-thickness / d_i)
0.4                     eps      (island size ratio)
2                       numIslands
1.0                     b0       (reference field, code units)
0.0                     bg       (guide-field ratio; 0 = anti-parallel)
-0.05                   perturb  (m=1 seed amplitude)
0.2                     nb       (background/peak density ratio)

#TIMESTEPPING
T                       useFixedDt
0.005                   dt   (resolves electron timescale for m_i/m_e = 25)

#NORMALIZATION
1.0e5                   lNormSI   [m]  ~ d_i so d_i ~ 1 in code units
1.0e5                   uNormSI   [m/s] tNorm = 1 s; sets cLight_SI = uNormSI

#MONITOR
100                     dnReport

#SAVELOG
10                      dnSavePic
10                      dnSavePT

#PARTICLES
4                       nParticle per cell in X
4                       nParticle per cell in Y

#SAVEPLOT
1                       nPlot
z=0 fluid ascii planet  plotString   (z cut; degenerate z in true-2D build)
-1                      dn
1.0                     dt
-1                      dx   (multi-level grid requires unstructured point output)

#STOP
-1                      MaxIter
3.0                     TimeMax   ~0.5 ion gyroperiod (reconnection onset)

#RUN

AMR setup: a thin box layer around the current sheet (|y| < 7.85 d_i)
is refined (REFINEREGION) to 2x resolution (REFINEMENTRATIO 2); see README.
#REGION
layer                   name
box                     shape
-31.4                   min
 31.4                   max
-7.85                   min
 7.85                   max

#REFINEREGION
0                       iLev
+layer                  regions

#GRIDEFFICIENCY
1.0                     gridEfficiency

#CONSTANTPPV
F                       isPPVconstant   (per-cell particle count; PC static AMR)
